title: Execution of the Land Reform
subtitle: Agriculture: how land is divided and who has access to it.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_land.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'land_program') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.land_program (technical reference 12.6, 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.8). One way of
// dividing the land and one rule of access in the same law. Choosing prepares the programme (1 T); its
// law and launch wait in the agenda. The political reaction comes when the law is adopted, the social
// effect only when a tranche is executed.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'land_program');
Q.pl_land_variant = '';
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_land');
!}

= Execution of the land reform

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Holding Agriculture does not change ownership by itself: the reform needs its law, its financing and one of three tranches of the country. Each executed tranche lowers the agrarian pressure by 3 once; it gives PPS no seats.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @compensated
- @accelerated
- @expropriation
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@compensated
title: Parcelation with compensation
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for four months; one unit of reform. Business pressure grows when the law passes (+8); the easiest basis of an agreement with Piast.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'compensated').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_compensated_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_land_variant = 'compensated';
!}
go-to: access

@accelerated
title: Accelerated parcelation with compensation
subtitle: The same unit faster, a bigger bill: costs the budget 3 units a month for three months; business pressure grows more (+12).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'accelerated').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_accelerated_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_land_variant = 'accelerated';
!}
go-to: access

@expropriation
title: Expropriation without compensation
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit a month for four months; business pressure jumps once (+25).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'expropriation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_expropriation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_land_variant = 'expropriation';
!}
go-to: access

@access
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_land_majority_why = PolishProjects.landAccessStatus(Q, 'polish_majority').reason;
!}

= Access to the land

The same law sets who may receive land. Nothing is spent until you choose.

- @equal
- @polish_majority
- @polish_gov_land: Choose another way of dividing the land.

@equal
title: Equal criteria of need and farm size
subtitle: The rule of the same law; no national preference.
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'land_program', Q.pl_land_variant, {access: 'equal'});
!}
go-to: result

@polish_majority
title: A preference for the Polish majority
subtitle: The trust of the excluded groups falls (−6); a breach of the legal equality promised to minority partners.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.landAccessStatus(Q, 'polish_majority').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_majority_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'land_program', Q.pl_land_variant, {access: 'polish_majority'});
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Execution of the land reform

